+++++++++++++++++++++++in UI of JENKINS==================
> create credentials
     = kind (ssh username and private key)
     = id(agent-key)
     = username (ubuntu)
     ==under private key click on ""enter directly""
     > now paste the private key(which you have copied in the master node)
   == now click on create
> now create node
  = name (agent)
  = remote root directory (/home/ubuntu/jenkins/)
  = launch method (via ssh)
       - host (public ip of agent(if agent and master node on same vpc) otherwise private)
       - select creds 
  = click on save ........now your agent would be created
